            "value" : "%lld s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5 hours" : {
      "comment" : "A usage limit period.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "5 horas"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access refused" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Acceso rechazado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access to the %@ session in the keychain was denied. Click Refresh to ask again." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the official app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se denegó el acceso a la sesión de %@ en el llavero. Pulsa Actualizar para volver a pedirlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Access" : {
      "comment" : "Button on the Cursor card that lets Uzzy read the key Cursor encrypts its session with.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permitir acceso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow access to the Cursor session" : {
      "comment" : "Title on the Cursor card when Cursor's session is encrypted and the user has not let Uzzy read its key.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Permite el acceso a la sesión de Cursor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks GitHub once a day for a newer version of %@, without sending any data about you. You install it yourself." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the app's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta a GitHub una vez al día si hay una versión más reciente de %@, sin enviar ningún dato tuyo. La instalas tú."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Billing cycle" : {
      "comment" : "A usage limit period.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ciclo de facturación"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel" : {
      "comment" : "Dismisses a confirmation without doing anything.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancelar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check for updates" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buscar actualizaciones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check usage limits now" : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip of the Refresh button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Consultar los límites de uso ahora"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking new account…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Consultando nueva cuenta…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking usage limits…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Consultando límites de uso…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close Window" : {
      "comment" : "The main menu command that closes the front window or the panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cerrar ventana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't connect to %@. Click Refresh to try again." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the provider.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo conectar con %@. Pulsa Actualizar para reintentar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't open the %@ session. Check that the official app works and click Refresh." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the official app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo abrir la sesión de %@. Comprueba que la app oficial funcione y pulsa Actualizar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't open the Cursor session or its key in the keychain. Check that Cursor works and the keychain is unlocked, then click Refresh." : {
      "comment" : "Cursor's session database or its key in the keychain could not be read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo abrir la sesión de Cursor ni su clave en el llavero. Comprueba que Cursor funcione y que el llavero esté desbloqueado, y pulsa Actualizar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't read the Claude Code session in the keychain. Check that it's unlocked and click Refresh." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer la sesión de Claude Code en el llavero. Comprueba que esté desbloqueado y pulsa Actualizar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't read the session" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer la sesión"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cursor encrypts its session with a key in your keychain. Click Refresh, then Allow Access." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when access to Cursor's key is needed and no button can be shown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cursor cifra su sesión con una clave de tu llavero. Pulsa Actualizar y luego Permitir acceso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cursor encrypts its session with a key in your keychain. The same key protects Cursor's other secrets, such as its MCP sign-ins. %@ uses it only to read the session, and macOS may ask you to allow it." : {
      "comment" : "Explains what the user grants before Uzzy reads Cursor's key. %@ is the app's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cursor cifra su sesión con una clave de tu llavero. Esa misma clave protege los demás secretos de Cursor, como sus inicios de sesión en MCP. %@ la usa solo para leer la sesión, y macOS puede pedirte que lo permitas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cursor sent the reset date in a format %@ doesn't recognize. Click Refresh; if it continues, the integration needs an update." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cursor envió la fecha de reinicio en un formato que %@ no reconoce. Pulsa Actualizar; si continúa, la integración necesita una actualización."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detailed" : {
      "comment" : "Settings choice: the countdown to a reset with two units, e.g. \"2 h 28 min\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Detallado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download %@ %@" : {
      "comment" : "The app's name, then the newer version, e.g. \"Download Uzzy 0.1.2\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Descargar %1$@ %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File" : {
      "comment" : "The main menu File menu.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Archivo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
